    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7d89a546c31b75fe8c49059",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听说了吗？　怒涛要跟歌剧在1800m赛上对决哦！\r\n叫什么『我与怒涛，华丽的交响曲』？　看，这是传单！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb4b91b94d4a10fc1666c29c5ffc655132efd06947f5a3eca1a21333007982c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
