      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "传单？　……虽然槽点不少，\r\n但总之，怒涛要去对决的话……绝对会搞砸的吧ー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffaa44b6be641231fd7166a723b227d0c76b537a5565f5424ffc1fe8a2a44436",
