    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4125a81e3fe16894e56f694",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她不是那种会翘掉训练的人。\r\n考虑到可能是出了什么差错，我决定去找她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6ec403942b8cfee581adae525154e5266ad5e3b516cae0e29de1b24cc6bc3db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
